      },
      "text": "A.F.K. Organski (*World Politics*, 1958) developed power transition theory as a critique of balance of power theory."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POWER-TRANSITION.md#008",
      "path": [
        "05-POWER-TRANSITION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
