        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Power Transition Theory and Hegemonic Wars",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Balance of power theory** (realist): states balance against power concentrations; equilibrium → stability."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POWER-TRANSITION.md#009",
      "path": [
        "05-POWER-TRANSITION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
