        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Power Transition Theory and Hegemonic Wars",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Organski's challenge**: Balance of power predicts war when power is equal (multipolar, competitive). But empirically, war is most likely during power transitions, not when balance is achieved."
    },
    {
