        "title": "Power Transition Theory and Hegemonic Wars",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MIDDLE AND SMALL POWERS:\n  Operate under the rules set by the top."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POWER-TRANSITION.md#014",
      "path": [
        "05-POWER-TRANSITION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
