        "section": "international-relations",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Power Transition Theory and Hegemonic Wars",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PHASE 4: RESOLUTION\n  If peaceful: the dominant power accommodates\n  the challenger (increases its share of benefits\n  in the order, reforms institutions).\n  If not: hegemonic war resets the order."
    },
    {
