      "text": "HISTORICAL EXAMPLES:\n  • Napoleonic Wars: Reset European order (1815)\n  • WWI/WWII: US replaced UK as hegemon (1918/1945)\n  • Cold War end: US emerged as unipolar (1991)\n```"
